  "description": "BLOCK CONNECTOR is a casual game with a very simple rule: connect blocks of the same colour, so even people who are not good at puzzle games can easily start playing.\n\r\n\n\r\nWe didn't use a game engine, but used our own library.\n\r\n\n\r\nNo need to think too much, just simply match the colours and keep defeating the boss, the polyhedron!\n\r\n\n\r\nThis is a slightly new puzzle game that retains the fun of existing dropout puzzles while adding its own originality, so you can play it with a fresh sensation.\n\r\n\n\r\nWe hope it will help you pass the time!",
  "description_short": "You are the block and now you have to connect the colourful blocks to defeat your enemy, the polyhedron.",
